  "name": "Breakfast Peppers, Chickpeas, and Tofu",
  "subtitle": "A smoky tomato skillet with creamy garlic yogurt",
  "description": "Tender peppers and chickpeas simmer in a spiced tomato base, then pair with tofu, garlic yogurt, and parsley.",
